OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry with cloud breaking to
OL,7,Fgive some clear spells. Turning cold
OL,8,Fwith frost developing inland and a few
OL,9,Fmist or fog patches possible. Chance
OL,10,Fof an isolated shower.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog
OL,13,Fclearing, then a largely dry day with
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and some sunny spells.
OL,15,FRemaining rather chilly with generally
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
